  "title": {
    "rendered": "Ultimate Split AC Repair Guide Vadodara | Prices, Error Codes &amp; Inverter Fixes"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<article class=\"atlas-split-ac-blog\">\n    <header style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h1 style=\"color: #e63946; font-size: 3em; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.5px;\">The Ultimate Split AC Repair &#038; Pricing Guide for Vadodara</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1.25em; color: #333; font-style: italic; border-left: 5px solid #1d3557; padding-left: 20px; margin: 25px auto; max-width: 900px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.7;\">When the Gujarat summer hits 45°C, a blinking light on your split AC isn&#8217;t just an annoyance—it&#8217;s an emergency. But before you call the first mechanic you find online, arm yourself with the truth. From transparent price lists to decoding what those flashing error codes actually mean, here is everything you need to know about Inverter and Non-Inverter AC repair.</p>\n        <div class=\"author-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 25px; font-size: 0.95em; color: #fff; background: #1d3557; display: inline-block; padding: 12px 25px; border-radius: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;\">\n            <span>By: Mehfuz Shahid Khan | Category: Home Cooling Guide | Read Time: 12 mins</span>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-banner\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d3557, #457b9d); color: white; padding: 40px 20px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\">\n        <h2 style=\"color: #f1faee; font-size: 2.2em; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: capitalize;\">Proffessional and Standard Ac installation in bharuch</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1.2em; color: #a8dadc; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">Bringing over two decades of heavy-duty HVAC and residential cooling expertise from Vadodara to our growing client base across the region.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;\">\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 300\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width: 750px;\">\n            <rect width=\"800\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#f8f9fa\" rx=\"15\" stroke=\"#dee2e6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            \n            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e63946\" stroke-width=\"4\" rx=\"10\"/>\n            <text x=\"200\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e63946\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Non-Inverter AC</text>\n            <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"160\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#f1faee\" stroke=\"#1d3557\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n            <path d=\"M 130 160 L 130 130 M 130 160 L 155 175 M 130 160 L 105 175\" stroke=\"#1d3557\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <rect x=\"200\" y=\"130\" width=\"80\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#a8dadc\" stroke=\"#1d3557\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"4\"/>\n            <text x=\"240\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fixed</text>\n            <text x=\"240\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Speed</text>\n\n            <line x1=\"400\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#ced4da\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 5\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"150\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#1d3557\"/>\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"157\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">VS</text>\n\n            <rect x=\"450\" y=\"50\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#2a9d8f\" stroke-width=\"4\" rx=\"10\"/>\n            <text x=\"600\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2a9d8f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Inverter AC</text>\n            <rect x=\"490\" y=\"120\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#264653\" rx=\"5\"/>\n            <rect x=\"500\" y=\"130\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#e9c46a\"/>\n            <rect x=\"530\" y=\"160\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e76f51\"/>\n            <line x1=\"490\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#264653\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <line x1=\"490\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#264653\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <path d=\"M 620 190 Q 640 120 670 190 Z\" fill=\"#a8dadc\" stroke=\"#1d3557\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <path d=\"M 610 130 Q 640 100 680 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a9d8f\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/>\n            <text x=\"645\" y=\"170\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Variable</text>\n        </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <section id=\"inverter-vs-non-inverter\" style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"color: #1d3557; font-size: 2em; border-bottom: 2px solid #1d3557; padding-bottom: 10px;\">\n            The Reality of Repair: Inverter vs. Non-Inverter\n        </h2>\n        <p>The biggest point of confusion for homeowners in Vadodara is understanding exactly what type of machine they have mounted on their wall. The repair protocols (and the costs) are entirely different.</p>\n        \n        <ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;\">\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; padding: 20px; background: #fdf0f1; border-left: 5px solid #e63946; border-radius: 5px;\">\n                <strong style=\"font-size: 1.2em; color: #e63946;\">Non-Inverter Split ACs: The Workhorses</strong><br>\n                These are the traditional units. The compressor is either 100% ON or 100% OFF. They are highly durable, easy to repair, and rely on mechanical parts like contactors and capacitors. If a non-inverter AC stops cooling, 70% of the time, it&#8217;s a blown ₹600 starting capacitor. \n            </li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; padding: 20px; background: #f0fdf4; border-left: 5px solid #2a9d8f; border-radius: 5px;\">\n                <strong style=\"font-size: 1.2em; color: #2a9d8f;\">Inverter Split ACs: The Computers</strong><br>\n                Inverter ACs save electricity by varying the compressor speed. However, they are essentially high-voltage computers. They rely on incredibly sensitive Outdoor PCBs (Printed Circuit Boards) equipped with IPMs (Intelligent Power Modules). A sudden voltage spike in your area will instantly fry an inverter PCB. Repairing these requires micro-electronics expertise, not just a wrench.\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"transparent-pricing\" style=\"margin-bottom: 50px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"color: #1d3557; font-size: 2em; border-bottom: 2px solid #1d3557; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n            Vadodara Split AC Repair &#038; Service Price List (2026)\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p>Tired of hidden charges? Over more than two decades, we have built our reputation on absolute technical integrity. Here is the standard, transparent pricing you should expect for high-quality, professional AC service.</p>\n\n        <div style=\"overflow-x:auto;\">\n            <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr style=\"background-color: #1d3557; color: #ffffff; text-align: left;\">\n                        <th style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Service / Repair Type</th>\n                        <th style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Estimated Cost (₹)</th>\n                        <th style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Important Note</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa;\">\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;\">Standard Jet Pump Wash</td>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; color: #e63946; font-weight: bold;\">₹499 &#8211; ₹699</td>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Includes indoor blower and outdoor condenser high-pressure wash.</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;\">Deep Chemical Foam Cleaning</td>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; color: #e63946; font-weight: bold;\">₹899 &#8211; ₹1,200</td>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Required for heavy dust/oil areas or severe cooling loss.</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa;\">\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;\">Gas Charging (R-32 / R-410A)</td>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; color: #e63946; font-weight: bold;\">₹2,200 &#8211; ₹2,800</td>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">*MUST include Nitrogen pressure testing and deep vacuuming. Top-ups are scams!</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;\">Capacitor Replacement</td>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; color: #e63946; font-weight: bold;\">₹450 &#8211; ₹850</td>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">For non-inverter units where the compressor isn&#8217;t starting.</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa;\">\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;\">Inverter PCB Repair (L1/L2)</td>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; color: #e63946; font-weight: bold;\">₹1,800 &#8211; ₹4,500</td>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Component level repair. Much cheaper than replacing the entire board.</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;\">New Split AC Installation</td>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; color: #e63946; font-weight: bold;\">₹1,200 &#8211; ₹1,500</td>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Core cutting and extra copper pipe lengths are charged additionally.</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 0.9em; color: #777; margin-top: 10px;\"><em>*Prices are estimates based on standard residential 1.5-ton units. Heavy commercial or highly complex routing may vary slightly.</em></p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"error-codes\" style=\"margin-bottom: 50px; background: #f4f8fb; padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9e2ec;\">\n        <h2 style=\"color: #1d3557; font-size: 2.2em; border-bottom: 3px solid #1d3557; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n            The Atomic Guide to AC Error Codes\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p>Is your indoor display blinking a weird letter and number? Your AC is literally trying to talk to you. Before you call a technician, check this ultimate cheat sheet for India&#8217;s top brands to know exactly what you are dealing with.</p>\n\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n            \n            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; background: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-top: 4px solid #0097e6;\">\n                <h3 style=\"color: #0097e6; margin-top: 0;\">Daikin Error Codes</h3>\n                <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n                    <li><strong>U4 / U5:</strong> Communication Error (Indoor and outdoor units cannot &#8220;talk&#8221;). Often a burnt wire or faulty PCB.</li>\n                    <li><strong>U0:</strong> Refrigerant Shortage. You have a gas leak. Turn off the AC immediately.</li>\n                    <li><strong>A3:</strong> Drain Water Level System Abnormality (Clogged drain pipe).</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; background: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-top: 4px solid #c23616;\">\n                <h3 style=\"color: #c23616; margin-top: 0;\">LG Dual Inverter Codes</h3>\n                <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n                    <li><strong>CH 38:</strong> Refrigerant gas leak detected. System locked to protect the compressor.</li>\n                    <li><strong>CH 05:</strong> Communication error between indoor and outdoor PCBs.</li>\n                    <li><strong>CH 10:</strong> Indoor blower fan motor locked or faulty.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; background: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-top: 4px solid #44bd32;\">\n                <h3 style=\"color: #44bd32; margin-top: 0;\">Voltas Error Codes</h3>\n                <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n                    <li><strong>E5:</strong> Indoor room temperature sensor failure. (Inexpensive repair).</li>\n                    <li><strong>E1:</strong> High pressure protection. Usually means the outdoor condenser is choked with dust and needs a heavy wash.</li>\n                    <li><strong>E6:</strong> Indoor evaporator coil freezing up (low gas or dirty filters).</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; background: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-top: 4px solid #192a56;\">\n                <h3 style=\"color: #192a56; margin-top: 0;\">Samsung Inverter Codes</h3>\n                <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n                    <li><strong>E1 01:</strong> Communication error between indoor/outdoor.</li>\n                    <li><strong>E4 22:</strong> EEV (Electronic Expansion Valve) blocked or faulty.</li>\n                    <li><strong>E4 64:</strong> Compressor IPM overcurrent. (Serious PCB or compressor issue).</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"why-choose-us\" style=\"margin-bottom: 50px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"color: #1d3557; font-size: 2em; border-bottom: 2px solid #1d3557; padding-bottom: 10px;\">\n            Why Atlas Aircon is Vadodara&#8217;s First Choice\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p>You wouldn&#8217;t let a rookie mechanic rebuild your car&#8217;s engine, so why let an amateur tear apart your ₹50,000 Inverter AC? We approach residential cooling with the exact same strict engineering protocols we use for massive industrial chillers in Makarpura and Waghodia.</p>\n\n        <p>Whether you need a simple capacitor swap on a window AC or a highly complex PCB micro-soldering job on a 2-ton inverter split system, our 20+ years of hands-on technical dominance ensures it gets fixed right the first time. No guessing. No &#8220;jugaad&#8221;. Just pure, uncompromised cooling restoration.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer style=\"margin-top: 60px; padding-top: 40px; border-top: 5px solid #e63946; text-align: center; background: #ffffff;\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: #1d3557; font-size: 2.2em; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 900;\">Is Your AC Flashing an Error Code or Blowing Hot Air?</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1.25em; color: #555; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto 30px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">Don&#8217;t sweat through the night or risk burning out your expensive compressor. Contact us for rapid, transparent, and expert Split AC repair anywhere in Vadodara.</p>\n        \n        <a href=\"/contact-us\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 18px 45px; background-color: #e63946; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1.3em; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.4); transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.3s ease;\">Book Your AC Service Expert Now</a>\n    </footer>\n</article>\n",
